<PageTitle>Tapes: DbnSuite</PageTitle>

<h1>Tapes</h1>
<p class="lead">
    Three compact, stream-only file formats for backtesting CME futures, built from your archive of Databento® files.
    They trade universality for size and speed: a tape replays a contract's trade date from start to finish, and does
    nothing else.
</p>

<DatabentoNotice />

